# Milestone tags. The `tags` workflow creates each one once the `ci` workflow has succeeded on
# its commit (docs/adr/0007-milestone-tags.md). One per line:
#
#   <tag> <full commit SHA> <message>
#
# Tags are never moved or deleted by the workflow. Lines stay in this file after their tag
# exists; the workflow skips tags that already point at their commit.
